cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Exploding-Sandpiles: a Lean 4 formalization, in progress, of A shape theorem for exploding sandpiles"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 / mathlib formalization, in progress, of the paper "A shape theorem
  for exploding sandpiles" (Bou-Rabee).  Every theorem, lemma and proposition
  of the paper is registered as a frozen statement, together with five further
  results the paper cites in its proofs, 29 in all.  Five are proved, with no
  custom axiom and no cited result taken as a hypothesis; two, among them the
  convergence of the rescaled arrival times, have written proofs that rest on
  open statements; seven are results the paper cites, stated as propositions
  and assumed; and fifteen, among them the limit shape theorem, are open,
  each a single registered sorry.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bou-Rabee
    given-names: Ahmed
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - Abelian sandpile
  - exploding sandpile
  - limit shape
  - probability
license: Apache-2.0
